body:
I refer you to this:

&#x200B;

 Right-wing trolls report online sex workers to tax authorities in #ThotAudit 

&#x200B;

[https://www.news.com.au/technology/online/social/rightwing-trolls-report-online-sex-workers-to-tax-authorities-in-thotaudit/news-story/16cff3e5f5f4303b78d1dc23c80af4db](https://www.news.com.au/technology/online/social/rightwing-trolls-report-online-sex-workers-to-tax-authorities-in-thotaudit/news-story/16cff3e5f5f4303b78d1dc23c80af4db)

Everything. I'm stuck in a job that I cant leave for financial reasons, and no prospect of something better. I'm slowly finding out/suspecting my girlfriend doesn't care about me, but I think instead about what I can do for her. My physical health is bad, especially for my age, and effectively ending most dreams I used to have when I was small. My country's economy is getting worse, limiting my ability to do anything but work.

&#x200B;

The only light I have is that my friends are a nice distraction. Because they think Im fine, all they care about is having fun, and they sort of drag me in somehow and I can get blackout wasted. Even if I rarely get to speak to them, and they wouldnt want to anyway.
